// Structure your response in three parts

class InterviewResponse {

    // Part 1: Honest acknowledgment (2-3 sentences)
    String acknowledgeOtherOptions() {
        return "Yes, I'm actively interviewing with a few companies. "
             + "As a fresher, I want to make sure I find the right fit "
             + "where I can learn and grow effectively.";
    }

    // Part 2: What makes THIS company stand out (3-4 sentences)
    String articulateWhatMakesThisSpecial() {
        return "What drew me to your team specifically is your focus on "
             + "microservices architecture and the mentorship program you mentioned. "
             + "I noticed your engineering blog talks about pair programming "
             + "and code review culture, which aligns with how I learn best. "
             + "The tech stack—Spring Boot, Kubernetes, PostgreSQL—is exactly "
             + "what I want to build expertise in.";
    }

    // Part 3: Close with enthusiasm without desperation
    String closeWithGenuineInterest() {
        return "I'm being thoughtful about where I start my career, "
             + "and based on what I've learned so far, this role feels like "
             + "a strong match for what I'm looking for.";
    }
}
